::  modules/brushstroke/glow/fold-canopy-canvas.glow -- Watershed Canvas!
/-  compiler-shapes
/!  32768
|%
++  gate-canopy-infiltration
  |=  [layers=@ud humus=@ud]                            ::  0..4 & 0..1000
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  permille <= 950
  ~|  'canopy-layers-exceed-four-story-bound'           ::  strict story cap
  ?>  &(lte(layers 4) lte(humus 1000))
  %+  add  100  (mul layers 140)
++  gate-canvas-viewport
  |=  [width-px=@ud height-px=@ud]                      ::  side-by-side px
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  verified width
  ~|  'canopy-canvas-viewport-below-160x80-floor'       ::  RLCD legibility
  ?>  &(gte(width-px 160) gte(height-px 80))
  width-px
--
